OL,3,AUS citizen Stephen Hubbard freed by
OL,4,ARussia as Trump envoy meets Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia released a 74-year-old American
OL,7,Fcitizen who was jailed for allegedly
OL,8,Ffighting on behalf of Ukraine, as
OL,9,FPresident Vladimir Putin met US envoy
OL,10,FSteve Witkoff in St Petersburg for
OL,11,Ftalks.
OL,13,FStephen Hubbard was taken to the city's
OL,14,FPulkovo Airport, Putin said during the
OL,15,Fmeeting early on Wednesday.
OL,17,FPresident Donald Trump later said the
OL,18,Fformer teacher was "on his way back
OL,19,Fhome" and "there was no 'swap'
OL,20,Fnecessary". Following the release,
OL,21,FWitkoff called Putin a humanitarian.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
