OL,3,AUS citizen Stephen Hubbard freed by
OL,4,ARussia as Trump envoy meets Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FHubbard, who was sentenced to almost
OL,7,Fseven years in a penal colony in 2024,
OL,8,Fwas accused of serving in a defence
OL,9,Funit in eastern Ukraine when he was
OL,10,Fcaptured in 2022, shortly after
OL,11,FRussia's full-scale invasion.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
